## VERTEX COLORS in EDIT MODE.

Change the vertex colors using edit mode.
It exists on the n+panel, and is pretty self explanatory.

### MODAL
pressing SHIT+ALT+E will enable a modal tool to edit selected faces on the fly by moving the mouse:
- `O`: toggle overlays (off by default)
- `V`: change value (on by default)
- `S`: change saturation
- `H`: change hue
on exit you can further adjust value before commiting to the change.
